-- title:
--   The explicit tolerance and constant for approximate Gaussian regularization
-- statement:
--   Define the weighted optimization tolerance at sample size \(n\) by
--   \[
--   \tau_n=\frac{1}{6144\log n}.
--   \]
--   With the structural support coefficient
--   \(S_{d,40,b}=10^7(1+161^d+(b+4))\), define
--   \[
--   A_{d,b}=S_{d,40,b}+\frac{10^7}{6144}.
--   \]
--   The tolerance is the allowed deficit from the optimal weighted log-likelihood in the approximate-optimizer conclusions. The additional term \(10^7/6144\) records its contribution to the ordinary fit bound. Both expressions specify exact constants, with the asymptotic interpretation taken at sufficiently large sample sizes.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/hanshengjiang/reweighted-npmle-lean/blob/5af8d16822c5a8a3f032b13eb95daea40f307484/ReweightedNPMLE/GaussianApproxRegularization.lean#L59-L63

